  "docs": {
    "gameplay": "# Quests\nCreate quests and complete their subtasks to earn XP. Every completed subtask awards 25 XP.\n\n## Levels\nEvery 100 lifetime XP raises your level by one. Spending XP never lowers your level.\n\n# Games\n\n## Blackjack\nBet XP against the dealer. A natural blackjack pays 3:2 and a push returns your bet.\n\n## Daily reward\nClaim the daily reward once every 24 hours. Claiming on consecutive days builds a streak that increases the bonus.\n",
    "commands": "# Commands\n\n## /list\nCreate, view and manage your quests and their subtasks.\n\n## /daily\nClaim the daily XP reward and keep your streak alive.\n\n## /automation\nToggle deadline reminder notifications. When it is on, the bot sends you a DM on the day a quest is due.\n\n## /leaderboard\nShows the players with the most XP.\n"
  }
